<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Foreigners buy 24.05 mln rand S.African bonds Tues.</title>
<headline>Foreigners buy 24.05 mln rand S.African bonds Tues.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foreigners bought a net 24.05  million rand worth of South African bonds on Tuesday after selling 73.64 million rand the previous day, the Bond Exchange said.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
